# Backend API base URL.
#
# Leave empty (or unset) when the frontend is served by the backend (default
# release build) or when running `pnpm dev` with the built-in Vite proxy — in
# both cases requests resolve against the page origin.
#
# Set this to the backend origin (no trailing slash) when deploying the
# frontend standalone and calling the API cross-origin. The backend must
# allow this frontend's origin via CORS, with credentials enabled (cookies
# carry the refresh token).
#
# Example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
